In collaboration with Propelland and The Coca Cola Company, these are a series of pilots conducted to evaluate the feasibility and desirability of a package-less hydration service. We created a functional prototype using an existing machine, an iPad, lots of IoT flows, and rapid prototyping.

The prototype was tested in 5 locations across 2 countries for several months. The data gathered from these pilots helped Coca Cola frame the service. The project is now being piloted in the Netherlands and France.
